WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:02,730
Eat quickly

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:04,450
Only when you are full can you have the strength to speak.

3
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:06,450
I have to go to the school playground for training tomorrow.

4
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:12,820
Chaoyan looks so formal

5
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,540
I think I just attended someone else's wedding and I stood up straight.

6
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:15,900
Don't go to that station like a question mark.

7
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:17,900
Today’s lesson is etiquette

8
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:20,420
The final exam meeting is held in a group format

9
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,100
Exit self-formed team and cross-version team

10
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:34,750
Submit your list before the end of this week

11
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:35,830
You can also help me take a look

12
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:37,590
I adjusted the parameters in several places.

13
00:00:37,590 --> 00:00:39,390
Energy efficiency will be stronger

14
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:41,750
Additionally, additional mecha repair modules have been added

15
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:42,830
add in this position

16
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:44,270
Does not affect mobility and combat

17
00:00:44,270 --> 00:00:45,350
and temporary energy

18
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:48,430
Both kinetic energy, wind and solar energy can provide sufficient energy in a completely closed environment.

19
00:00:48,430 --> 00:00:50,950
You can also rely on kinetic energy to last 24 hours. Mom, you are so cool.

20
00:00:50,950 --> 00:00:52,910
Imagining the functional properties of all accessories to the extreme

21
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:55,350
The real thing is almost the same as the design. How about the speed?

22
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:56,390
30% improvement

23
00:00:56,390 --> 00:00:57,950
Tomorrow's game will definitely be exciting.
